        "summary_en": "Vertical Aerospace says the British Standards Institution granted it AS9100 certification covering its quality management system across design and production. The company considers itself the first eVTOL developer to receive the certification; the same standard is also used by Airbus and Boeing. Quantum Systems says drones operated by the Bundeswehr resumed flying after a precautionary grounding, but the German military has not independently confirmed this. Four SpiceJet flights departing Dubai were reportedly canceled over unpaid airport fees.",
